# --- Assets & Resources ---
# Keep them visible so you can @ them, but don't index their content.
*.xcassets/
*.json
*.strings
*.plist

# --- Documentation & Planning ---
# Prevents Cursor from getting "confused" by old versions of your roadmap.
Docs/Archive/
*.notes
*.todo

# --- Mock Data & Testing ---
# Crucial: You want to manually @ these in tests, but don't want 
# search results cluttered with 5,000 lines of fake data.
Tests/Mocks/
**/Mock*.swift
Preview Content/

# --- Third-Party / External ---
# If you have local versions of libraries or vendored code.
Pods/
Vendor/

# --- Legacy / Reference ---
# Any "v1" folders or reference code you aren't currently editing.
Legacy/
ReferenceCode/